# machine.env.example — per-machine path overrides for the automation suite.
#
# SETUP (each machine): copy this file to `machine.env` at the repo root and
# uncomment/edit what differs on your machine. machine.env is GITIGNORED —
# it never leaves your computer. If you skip this entirely, scripts use the
# owner's original paths (fine on the owner's Mac, will fail elsewhere).
#
# Resolution order everywhere: process env var > machine.env > script default.
#
# After editing, run `python3 shared/paths.py` to confirm every path resolves and is
# writable on this machine before running a real script.

# ── Shared roots (cover most outputs) ────────────────────────────────────

# Local mirror of the company OneDrive. Nearly all report outputs derive
# from this: -Inbox- Project Report Exports, Automations- (Bill Tracker,
# statement reconciles, PROJECT P&Ls), Works In Progress/QBO Audits,
# Company Files - WIP Report, Collections.
# Owner default: ~/Library/CloudStorage/OneDrive-ProficientConcrete,LLC
# Dev machines without company OneDrive: point at any scratch folder.
#ACB_ONEDRIVE_BASE=/Users/YOURNAME/dev-outputs/onedrive

# Local, non-cloud-synced folder for company-health workbooks
# (health dashboard, customer overrides, legacy bill tracker).
# Owner default: ~/Documents/CompanyHealth
#ACB_COMPANYHEALTH_DIR=/Users/YOURNAME/dev-outputs/companyhealth

# The AI Brain_Vault — the business brain and the systems/process registry.
# READ-ONLY from this repo: the ledger's Systems tab renders 02_processes/*.md
# live, and nothing here ever writes to it.
# Owner default: ~/Documents/Claude/AI Brain_Vault
# A machine with no vault: leave unset — the Systems tab shows a one-line note
# and every other tab keeps working.
#ACB_VAULT_DIR=/Users/YOURNAME/Documents/Claude/AI Brain_Vault

# ── Per-file overrides (pre-existing keys, still honored) ────────────────

# Open_Invoices.xlsx mirror written by the invoice sync.
#INVOICE_EXPORT_PATH=/Users/YOURNAME/dev-outputs/Open_Invoices.xlsx

# WIP master workbook read/written by the WIP readers (Test tabs only).
#WIP_EXCEL_PATH=/Users/YOURNAME/dev-outputs/WIP - MASTER new.xlsx

# General List (LISTA GENERAL) — the estimators' contract entry sheet on
# Synology. Read READ-ONLY by the bill tracker for RP draw semantics; the code
# NEVER writes to it. Owner default: /Volumes/Common/OPERATIONS/GENERAL LIST/…
# Unmounted / unreadable → RP matching degrades to amount-cover only.
#ACB_GENERAL_LIST_XLSX=/Volumes/Common/OPERATIONS/GENERAL LIST/LISTA GENERAL AÑO 2026.xlsx

# The raw QBO mirror (shared/qbo_mirror). Default: ~/Library/Application Support/Proficient/qbo_mirror.sqlite3
# ACB_QBO_MIRROR_DB=/ABSOLUTE/PATH/TO/qbo_mirror.sqlite3
